<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Olympic Financial cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Olympic Financial cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Piper Jaffray said it cut its rating on Olympic Financial Ltd to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;(I)t may take time for Olympic Financial to re-establish credibility with investors,&quot; the brokerage said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down one at 13-7/8.</p>
</text>
